But careful: contrato says rotas _teste/* respond 404 without MODO_TESTE; with MODO_TESTE works. Tests set MODO_TESTE=1.

Let me first run the existing suite to see it passes (baseline). Then add a test for CORS (test/m1-cors.test.js or similar), write the middleware in app.js, run suite.

