  <h1>Grade de atividades</h1>
  <button type="button" id="botao-nova-atividade" class="botao">Nova atividade</button>
</div>
```

Hmm but h1 is inside section grade. Let me restructure minimally: keep h1, add button after filters:

Actually put the button right after the h1? Let me wrap:

```html
<section id="grade">
