fetch POST; set Content-Type application/json; X-Usuario. On 201: parse Atividade, render confirmation using returned data: "Atividade criada: <titulo> (id <id>, situação <rótulo>)". Hide form? Show confirmation + keep "Voltar para a grade" button. The botao-cancelar-criacao becomes "Voltar para a grade". After success, we hide the form and show confirmation. Add a disabled? Keep simple: hide form (form.hidden = true) and show confirmation; the "Voltar" button returns to grade.

